 "findings": {
  "mc-trades": [
   "1.21.4/1.21.8/1.21.11: Bukkit.createMerchant(Component) and HumanEntity.openMerchant(Merchant, boolean) are deprecated (not on 1.21.1): sheets now teach MenuType.MERCHANT.builder().title(..).merchant(m).build(p).open(); warning rule merchant-menu-type"
  ],
  "mc-utility": [
   "Test Flight runner: the `plugins` reply wraps after ~10 names and the continuation line has no dash or comma, so the 11th plugin read as NOT enabled; parsePluginList now reads every line under a 'Bukkit/Paper Plugins:' header (unit test added)"
  ],
  "mc-components": [
   "Eating moved: FoodComponent.setEatSeconds exists only on 1.21.1 (any item edible there); 1.21.4+ needs the consumable data component. Sheets + failure rule food-eat-seconds-moved; per-version Compat in the golden plugin",
   "ItemMeta.setFireResistant/isFireResistant are deprecated on 1.21.4+ (fine on 1.21.1): sheets teach setDamageResistant(DamageTypeTags.IS_FIRE); golden Compat per version"
  ],
  "mc-events": [
   "1.21.11 deprecates every GameRule.* constant FOR REMOVAL (org.bukkit.GameRules replaces them, several renamed: DO_DAYLIGHT_CYCLE->ADVANCE_TIME, DO_INSOMNIA->SPAWN_PHANTOMS ...): 1.21.11 sheet fixed, warning rule gamerule-constants-1-21-11, deterministic autofix fixGameRules (same-meaning renames only)"
  ],
  "mc-bows": [
   "Bukkit metadata API (FixedMetadataValue/MetadataValue) is deprecated on 1.21.11: sheets teach PDC tags; golden uses PDC"
  ],
  "mc-trails": [
   "Player.isOnGround() is deprecated on every 1.21.x (client-controlled): sheets say check the block below"
  ],
  "mc-brew": [
   "ItemMeta.customName(Component) does not exist on 1.21.1 (compile error): sheets already said 1.21.4+, now also an explicit 1.21.1 line; golden uses displayName"
  ],
  "mc-ranks": [
   "runtime permission attachments are a scan WARNING (perm-attach), shown to the owner; documented in the matrix limits"
  ],
  "datapack-lane": [
   "#minecraft:enchantable/sword was removed in 1.21.11 (vanilla ids): the validator refuses it with the version reason; the prompt now names #minecraft:enchantable/sharp_weapon (every version)"
  ],
  "mc-moderation": [
   "ProfileBanList.addBan with a name-only profile (Bukkit.createProfile(name)) throws 'An unexpected error' on 1.21.4 and 1.21.11: sheets teach OfflinePlayer.ban(reason, Duration, source) for a cached player; golden fixed"
  ],
  "mc-holo": [
   "1.21.9+ (1.21.11) has no spawn chunks: a TextDisplay spawned at spawn from the console unloaded at once and 'holo clear' found 0 (passed on 1.21.4): sheets teach plugin chunk tickets / spawn near players; golden adds addPluginChunkTicket"
  ],
  "mc-furniture": [
   "same 1.21.11 spawn-chunk finding as mc-holo for ItemDisplay/Interaction furniture"
  ]
 },
